Package: tokens-go-brrr
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-notify-0.7, libnotify-bin
Maintainer: Fredrick Makoffu <42011427+fredrickmakoffu@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/fredrickmakoffu/cursor-spend-monitor
Description: Daemon and CLI for AI coding usage limits
 A local daemon and CLI that track usage limits for AI coding tools (Cursor,
 Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, Pi). Install tokens-go-brrr-gnome or
 tokens-go-brrr-plasma for a panel UI. Run `tokens-go-brrr setup` after install.
